#
# The build context is services/ml_service and the image copies api/ wholesale (api/Dockerfile), so
# anything left lying in api/ ships. What the serving image must never carry is excluded here:
# tests and their requirements, the notebook helpers, and any local tracking store or cache.
tests/
notebooks/
requirements-dev.txt
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/mlruns/
**/mlartifacts/
